      "mobile_application": "- User authentication (Email/Phone/SSO)\n- Secure login and logout\n- Mark attendance (Check-in / Check-out)\n- View attendance history\n- Leave request submission\n- Attendance status notifications\n- Profile management\n- Offline attendance support with synchronization\n- Push notifications",
