      "leave_management": "- Apply for leave\n- View leave status\n- Admin approval/rejection\n- Leave balance tracking",
      "reporting": "- Daily attendance report\n- Monthly attendance report\n- Employee attendance summary\n- Late arrivals\n- Early departures\n- Absent reports",
      "non_functional_requirements": "- Responsive mobile interface\n- Secure communication (HTTPS)\n- Data encryption\n- High availability\n- Scalable backend\n- Fast response times (<2 seconds for standard operations)\n- Regular backups\n- Activity logging",
